'''Mamoluga''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Tales of the Nekoluga (Gacha Event)|Tales of the Nekoluga]] gacha event. It was added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]].

