==Trivia==
*Mamoluga's Japanese name, Mamoruga, is derived from 守る ''mamoru'' (to protect, guard or watch carefully).
*The [[Ototo Corps#Iron Wall|Iron Wall Cat]], [[Meditation Cat (Special Cat)|Meditation Cat]], Mamolan Pasalan, and [[Cheetah Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Cheetah Cat]] are the only units with 0 speed.
*Mamolan Pasalan has the longest standing range and 2nd-highest effective range of any Cat Unit, the 1st being tied between [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Nerd Cat]] and [[The 6th Angel (Uber Rare Cat)|The 6th Angel]], both with up to 1,500 range.
*The [[Ototo Corps#Iron Wall|Iron Wall Cat]], [[Meditation Cat (Special Cat)|Meditation Cat]], The [[Conjure|Conjured spirits]] and Mamolan Pasalan are the only [[Cat Units]] that are [[Immune to Boss Shockwave]].
*Mamolan Pasalan's [[Conjure|Conjured]] spirit has the highest range at 1,300, and along with [[Squire Luno (Uber Rare Cat)|Squire Luno]], they are the only spirits to not have 800 range.
*Mamolan Pasalan is likely a reference to [https://seesaawiki.jp/urugege/d/%C0%E9%C7%AF%A4%CB%B0%EC%CA%E2%CA%E2%A4%AF%C4%BB The Bird That Takes One Step a Millennium], one of the most commonly used [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare]] units in another [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] game: [[Yuru-i GeGeGe no Kitarou: Youkai Dotabata Daisensou|YuruGeGe]]. Both Mamolan Pasalan and the The Bird have 0 speed, exceptional range, an "enemy attack power down" mechanic, and similar attack animations.

